{"id":"H2753","lemma":"חֹרִי","transliteration":"chori","sayIt":"cho-RI","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hori","meaning":"A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Num.13.5;\nfather of: Shaphat (H8202)\n§ Hori = \"cave dweller\"\n1) a Horite, son of Lotan, the son of Seir\n2) a Simeonite, father of Shaphat","glosses":["hori"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hori","kjv":"were Hori"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":30,"renderings":{"kjv":"that came of Hori"}},{"chapterId":"num-13","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hori"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hori","kjv":"Hori"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:22","note":"The children of Lotan were Hori and Heman. Lotan’s sister was Timna.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 13:5","note":"Of the tribe of Simeon, Shaphat the son of Hori.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:39","note":"The sons of Lotan: Hori and Homam; and Timna was Lotan’s sister.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H2752","lemma":"חֹרִי","transliteration":"chori","gloss":"Horite"},{"id":"H1950","lemma":"הוֹמָ֑ם","transliteration":"homam","gloss":"Hemam"},{"id":"H8202","lemma":"שָׁפָט","transliteration":"shaphat","gloss":"Shaphat"},{"id":"H3877","lemma":"לוֹטָן","transliteration":"lotan","gloss":"Lotan"},{"id":"H1967","lemma":"הֵימָם","transliteration":"hemam","gloss":"Hemam"}],"senses":[{"id":"H2753H","gloss":"Hori","relation":"H2753H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}